  <item>
    <title>冬天收藏好自己，迎接更好的2026 年！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695a183d14db1df9ef4edf78</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695a183d14db1df9ef4edf78</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jan 2026 07:53:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们最后的一期播客啦，跟大家分享这个冬天如何收藏好自己，迎接新的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家这两年对我们的喜欢，忍受我们不靠谱的声音收集这么久。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们后面会开新的内容创作，到时候会来跟大家汇报咯。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a>:异常天气！今年冬天特别冷还是热？如何养生应对气候变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:冬至之后，阳气升起，如何顺应自然界的节气变化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a>:解决失眠、头疼和心悸的方法！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a>:中年人的压力与运动：瑜伽、按摩和喝椰子水的调养方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="607">00:10:07</a>:北方甘蔗汁：养阴又润燥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">00:12:09</a>:心悸与血压波动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">00:14:10</a>:明年将更热，燥火对心脑血管系统不友好，建议采取相应措施</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="974">00:16:14</a>:明年的机会比今年更好，但会更加焦虑和耗尽精力！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">00:18:14</a>:玩转明年：小心心脏，谨慎投资，保持冷静</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">00:22:19</a>:降低期待值，迎接最坏结果的能力：心境上头的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">00:24:21</a>:健康养生指南：重视饮食与睡眠，轻松过冬！</span></p>]]></description>
