    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>抑郁和焦虑的躯体化现象，是最近听到很多次的名词。所以，这次我们来聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">00:02:02</a>:学科之间的界限模糊导致治疗混乱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">00:04:03</a>:神经、心理、精神科：三科背后的药物一致性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">00:07:31</a>:案发现场的谜团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="682">00:11:22</a>:心理问题躯体化：解读身体与大脑的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">00:15:10</a>:焦虑症引发的身体症状：一个小关节的疼痛与焦虑的躯体化表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">00:18:59</a>:整合医学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1594">00:26:34</a>:了解焦虑与抑郁的背后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">00:30:22</a>:心理咨询师的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">00:34:09</a>:心理学中的信任建立：一个复杂而重要的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2277">00:37:57</a>:引导思考，超越困扰——与情绪型患者交流的技巧与方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2506">00:41:46</a>:学会接受与陪伴：抑郁、焦虑患者的困境与挑战</span></p>]]></description>
